{"sourceUrl":"https://www.tjsl.sdu.edu.cn/info/1056/14633.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:07.744025+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.tjsl.sdu.edu.cn/info/1056/14633.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>根据学校关于做好接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读</span></span><span>硕士</span><span><span>研究生工作要求，现将我院接收推免生复试录取工作的具体要求及安排通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<h2><span>一、</span><span>招生专业</span></h2>\n<p><span><span>我院</span>2027<span>年接收推荐免试硕士研究生专业如下，各专业具体招生计划请关注后续通知。</span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>类型</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>招生专业</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>研究方向</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>学术型</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>080100</span><span>力学</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>不区分研究方向</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>081400</span><span>土木工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01</span><span>岩土工程、桥梁与隧道工程、防灾减灾工程及防护工程</span></span></p><p><span><span>02</span><span>结构工程</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>0814Z1</span><span>建筑与城乡规划设计</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>不区分研究方向</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>081500</span><span>水利工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>不区分研究方向</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>专业型</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>085900</span><span>土木水利</span></span></p><p><br/></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01</span><span>结构工程</span></span></p><p><span><span>02</span><span>岩土工程、桥梁与隧道工程、工程软件、防灾减灾工程及防护工程 </span></span></p><p><span><span>03</span><span>先进材料与结构 </span></span></p><p><span><span>04</span><span>水利工程 </span></span></p><p><span><span>05</span><span>土木与水利工程安全检测与监测</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br/></p>\n<h2><span>二、预报名</span></h2>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>．预计可获得或已经获得所在本科毕业学校推荐免试资格的考生均可报名，暂未确定是否可以获得推荐免试资格的考生可先行报考</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>．报名时间：</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>-9</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日。</span></span><span>申请人通过山东大学研究生招生平台在线报名，网站地址：</span><a href=\"https://sduyjs.sdu.edu.cn/yjszs/plugins/zs/zsxsd/entrance#/entrance\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://sduyjs.sdu.edu.cn/yjszs/plugins/zs/zsxsd/entrance#/entrance</span></span></span></a><span> <span>，打开网站后，</span></span><span><span>选择</span><span>“</span></span><span>推荐免试硕士研究生和本科直博生预报名</span><span>”进入</span><span><span>后搜索</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>土建与水利学院</span></span><span>”，按照提示完成报名</span><span><span>。</span> <span>请考生务必在</span></span><span>规定时间内</span><span>完成</span><span>报名</span><span>申请，认真核对报名信息，确保为提交状态。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>3. </span><span>首次登录系统请注册，已报名夏令营的考生无需再次注册</span></span><span>，</span><span>直接使用夏令营时注册的账号登录即可</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span>报名结束后，</span><span><span>我院</span></span><span>将</span><span><span>依据材料审核成绩，结合招生计划，择优确定来校参加综合考核的人员。请考生及时关注预推免报名系统。</span></span></p>\n<h2><span>三、申请材料</span></h2>\n<p><span>1. </span><span>个人简历</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span>攻读</span><span>硕士</span><span>研究生</span><span>申请书</span><span>，内容包括对</span><span>所</span><span>申请专业的认识及未来学习科研规划等</span><span>，</span><span>格式自定；</span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核表</span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>附件</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>4. </span><span>本科阶段成绩单，须加盖学校教务主管部门公章；</span></p>\n<p><span>5. </span><span>外语水平证明或外语资格考试成绩单；</span></p>\n<p><span>6. </span><span>重要获奖证书；</span></p>\n<p><span>7. </span><span>能</span><span>体现自身学术水平的代表性学术</span><span>成果，包括但不限于学术</span><span>论文、出版物</span><span>、</span><span>原创性工作成果等；</span></p>\n<p><span>8. </span><span>在校期间参军入伍服兵役、参加志愿服务、到国际组织实习等证明材料；</span></p>\n<p><span>9. </span><span>回避情况说明。凡有直系亲属或利益相关人员在我校工作，尤其是在所申请推免的招生单位工作的，要主动说明报备。对未按规定报备声明回避关系且影响推免招生过程和结果公平公正的学生，学校将取消其推免录取资格；</span></p>\n<p><span>10. </span><span>本人亲手签名的诚信承诺书</span><span>（</span><span><span>附件</span><span>2</span></span><span>）</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>11. </span><span>申请人认为的其他必要材料。</span></p>\n<h2><span>四、复试</span></h2>\n<p><span>具体复试日期、时间、形式和复试录取办法将在我院网站另行公布。</span></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>附：山东</span></strong><strong><span>大学</span></strong><strong><span>2027</span></strong><strong><span>年接收推荐免试硕士研究生和本科直博生预报名通知</span></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.yz.sdu.edu.cn/info/1022/1463.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://www.yz.sdu.edu.cn/info/1022/1463.htm</span></a></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div><div></div></div>","textSha256":"08034701bee55cd8b61e37b416a601ad29bbb28bec82351cbe85869b4c3712f7","textLength":1120,"sourceSha256":"48782560390b6ed83794df1c88e7b8a038d5d5f8e6f5e17537f85fe12b68b137","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"山东大学报考硕士研究生人员思想政治素质和品德考核表.doc","url":"https://www.tjsl.sdu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1400494133&wbfileid=18215756"},{"name":"诚信承诺书.docx","url":"https://www.tjsl.sdu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1400494133&wbfileid=18215755"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3c876ba25975dfe910b0","title":"2026年山东大学土建与水利学院2027年推荐免试预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:07.744025+00:00"}
